# The release package's proof, run by CI from the unpacked archive (software renderer, 960x600):
# the home region on a summer morning and Rome's Forum, each checked for a drawn picture (not a
# black or flat frame) and saved in the working directory for a person to look at.
set weather clear
set season summer
set time 0.3
set land 4
key home
wait 600
expect away no
expect contrast 0,80,960,440 12
shot proof-home.png
set time 0.4
set world forum 1
wait 600
expect region rome
expect away yes
expect contrast 0,80,960,440 12
shot proof-rome.png
quit
